@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false

state "UA\nUP + ACTIVE" as UA
state "DA\nDOWN + ACTIVE" as DA
state "DI\nDOWN + INACTIVE\n排空中" as DI
state "UI\nUP + INACTIVE\n等待排空停止" as UI
state "REMOVED" as Removed

[*] --> UA
UA --> DA : DiskDown
DA --> UA : DiskUp
DA --> DI : BeginDrain
DI --> UI : DiskMap = Up\n状态机ensure Online
UI --> DI : DiskDown
UI --> UA : 旧Offline稳定退出\n新Online完成
DI --> Removed : DrainCompleted

note right of DI
DA -> DI 可逆
不代表必须走到 REMOVED
end note

note bottom of UI
已提交BG remap保持不变
在途BG到安全点后返回
未调度BG不再启动
旧Future退出后才启动Online
替换由Runtime ActorCell完成
end note

note bottom of Removed
当前示例中的终局边界
精确定义留给专项流程
end note
@enduml
